<title>UK: OCE NV sets 300 mln guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>OCE NV sets 300 mln guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OCE-VAN DER GRINTEN NV</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    20.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.855   PAY DATE    20.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.28     SPREAD	+51.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
